# quit-all: upstream tests (tests/parity/upstream_quit_all_*/) that tests/flows/test_upstream.py
# does not run against the ported flow, one per line: <test id>  <why>. Every other test of the
# app's own suite runs unchanged against store_release/flows/quit_all/.
test_ios_release.CreativeGateTests.test_every_ios_switch_is_printed_and_documented  reads the app's store/gates.env.example, which store-release's own gates.env.example and docs/switches.md replace (tests/workflows/test_docs.py)
test_ios_release.PrintGatesTests.test_gates_and_summary_agree_on_valid_values  tests the app's scripts/store/print_gates.py; store-release prints the switches with `run.py print-switches` (tests/unit/test_core.py)
test_ios_release.PrintGatesTests.test_invalid_values_are_shown_as_invalid_not_false  tests the app's scripts/store/print_gates.py; store-release prints the switches with `run.py print-switches` (tests/unit/test_core.py)
test_ios_release.RedactLogsTests.test_command_reads_the_ids_from_the_environment  tests the app's log redactor; store-release redacts with `run.py ios redact-logs`, a superset of every app's rules (tests/unit/test_flows.py RedactUnionTests)
